const html = "<section class=\"page\" data-screen-label=\"01\" style=\"font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#010F32;background:#F4F3F3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden\">\n\n<div style=\"position:relative;height:352px;background:#010F32;overflow:hidden;flex:none\">\n<img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/2b6d18bf-922c-4bbd-bfa7-1b1c84642bc3/ta-hero.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 28%\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(1,15,50,0.62) 0%,rgba(1,15,50,0.34) 38%,rgba(1,15,50,0.94) 100%)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;padding:34px 48px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;color:#F4F3F3\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:24px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\"><img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/3c77213e-3f54-4992-9b33-bfd042812da1/tgr-logo-lockup.png\" alt=\"The Great Repurpose\" style=\"height:46px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;display:block\"></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,243,243,0.8)\">Outplacement, reimagined for an AI-shaped future</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h1 style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:66px;line-height:0.92;letter-spacing:-0.028em;margin:0\">Transition Academy</h1>\n<div style=\"width:72px;height:4px;background:#06B5B2;margin:16px 0 14px 0\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:640px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.36;font-weight:400\">The Great Repurpose is the human reinvention and AI agency that traditional outplacement is missing.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"padding:18px 48px 16px 48px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(1,15,50,0.14);flex:none\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13.4px;line-height:1.46;text-wrap:pretty\">Traditional providers help people find another job. The Great Repurpose Academy prepares them for the future of work.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13.4px;line-height:1.46;text-wrap:pretty\">Through the five-part framework and community immersion, it leads them to understand who they are when the job disappears, what they want next, and how AI can amplify the person they choose to become.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"padding:20px 48px 0 48px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n<span style=\"width:11px;height:11px;background:#FA4B35;display:block\"></span>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:0.12em;margin:0\">THE PROBLEM</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty\">AI is making the things that used to be the most valuable worthless. Skills, expertise, degrees, and tasks have always been visible indicators of value. AI is now commoditizing those things, leaving people wondering what's valuable now.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty\">If you're in the unfortunate situation where you have to downsize your organization, you very well may be paying good money for offboarding services that leave your ex employees feeling less supported than if you had done nothing in the first place. Polishing their resume doesn't matter if that job is no longer in demand. Career counselling uses frameworks for careers that no longer exist.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty\">Your offboarding program addresses skills, expertise, and resumes \u2014 the exact things AI is making less valuable. You're preparing people for a market that's shifting underneath them. And people who leave feeling discarded rather than supported are the ones who come back at you.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n<img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/1b545b4b-4866-4e73-97ea-0246dc7c2cf0/ta-problem.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:180px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%;display:block\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;border-top:2px solid #FA4B35;padding-top:8px\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:29px;color:#FA4B35;line-height:1\">70%</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.34; color: rgba(1,15,50,0.82); font-weight: 700\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap;\">of the skills used in most jobs will change by 2030</span></b></span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;border-top:1px solid rgba(1,15,50,0.16);padding-top:8px\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:29px;color:#FA4B35;line-height:1\">0.4%</span>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.34;color:rgba(1,15,50,0.82)\"><b>Dignified exits: 0.4% sue. Undignified ones: 14.9%</b></span>\n</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;border-top:1px solid rgba(1,15,50,0.16);padding-top:8px\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:29px;color:#FA4B35;line-height:1\">55%</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.34;color:rgba(1,15,50,0.82)\"><b>of companies that cut staff for AI now say those were the wrong calls</b></span>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#192EEB;color:#F4F3F3;padding:16px 48px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:20px;flex:none\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:500\">The Great Repurpose Transition Academy helps departing employees leave with greater agency, clarity and readiness for an AI-shaped future.</p>\n<span style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;color:rgba(244,243,243,0.7);white-space:nowrap\">1 / 2</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"page\" data-screen-label=\"02\" style=\"font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#010F32;background:#F4F3F3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden\">\n\n<div style=\"padding:26px 48px 16px 48px;flex:none\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n<span style=\"width:11px;height:11px;background:#192EEB;display:block\"></span>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:0.12em;margin:0\">THE PROMISE</h2>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px 30px\">\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 1fr;gap:9px;font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#06B5B2;font-weight:600\">\u2192</span><span>Transforming layoff from a traumatic experience into an empowering one</span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 1fr;gap:9px;font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#06B5B2;font-weight:600\">\u2192</span><span>Helping people unhook their identity from their job title, role and tasks</span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 1fr;gap:9px;font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#06B5B2;font-weight:600\">\u2192</span><span>Reclaiming the value found in who they are and how they work\u2014not only what they do</span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 1fr;gap:9px;font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#06B5B2;font-weight:600\">\u2192</span><span>Rediscovering the strengths, qualities and ways of thinking they carry into any role</span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 1fr;gap:9px;font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#06B5B2;font-weight:600\">\u2192</span><span>Connecting personal value to a larger sense of purpose and possibility</span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 1fr;gap:9px;font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#06B5B2;font-weight:600\">\u2192</span><span>Building generative, creative and critical thinkers who can create new pathways rather than fit into outdated ones</span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 1fr;gap:9px;font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#06B5B2;font-weight:600\">\u2192</span><span>Developing the practical AI agency needed to navigate an AI-shaped future</span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:12px 1fr;gap:9px;font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#06B5B2;font-weight:600\">\u2192</span><span>Replacing the isolation of job loss with a structured community moving through the five stages together</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:0;flex:none\">\n<img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/66b5084a-cc11-421e-9518-cf0ad6011419/ta-strip1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:92px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 32%;display:block\"><img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/4f0990ac-a127-4eb6-9aa5-e6d7c68e985b/ta-strip2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:92px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 28%;display:block\"><img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/1e18ccc7-b881-4580-b42a-7df8f62dd501/ta-strip3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:92px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%;display:block\"><img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/14dd8caf-5495-4032-8050-255c9a58d29a/ta-strip4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:92px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 26%;display:block\"><img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/ba4b3501-79b5-414a-8540-59866ad3b2d7/ta-strip5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:92px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 34%;display:block\">\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"padding:20px 48px 26px 48px;flex:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(1,15,50,0.14)\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:0.12em;margin:0 0 12px 0\">FIVE STAGES. ONE JOURNEY.</h2>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"border-top:4px solid #192EEB;padding-top:9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#192EEB\">01</div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;line-height:1.14\">Unhook Identity</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.34;font-style:italic;color:rgba(1,15,50,0.72)\">\u201cI'm not my job.\u201d</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:4px solid #06B5B2;padding-top:9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#059C99\">02</div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;line-height:1.14\">Reclaim Value</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.34;font-style:italic;color:rgba(1,15,50,0.72)\">\u201cBut I AM this.\u201d</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:4px solid #8D51C7;padding-top:9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#8D51C7\">03</div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;line-height:1.14\">Discover Purpose</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.34;font-style:italic;color:rgba(1,15,50,0.72)\">\u201cWhat matters to me.\u201d</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:4px solid #ECB626;padding-top:9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#A87A10\">04</div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;line-height:1.14\">Become AI Ready</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.34;font-style:italic;color:rgba(1,15,50,0.72)\">\u201cUnderstand AI's power to amplify your ideas.\u201d</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:4px solid #FA4B35;padding-top:9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#FA4B35\">05</div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;line-height:1.14\">Relaunch Yourself</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.34;font-style:italic;color:rgba(1,15,50,0.72)\">\u201cTurn who you are into work, opportunity, and income.\u201d</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding: 18px 48px 0 48px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; width: 714px; height: 297px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n<span style=\"width:11px;height:11px;background:#8D51C7;display:block\"></span>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:0.12em;margin:0\">WHAT THEY GET</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;column-gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty;margin:0 0 12px 0;break-inside:avoid\">We replace the isolation of job loss with a structured community-based experience moving members through five distinct and empowering stages.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty;margin:0 0 12px 0;break-inside:avoid\">The stages take them through the process of decoupling their identity from work and tasks, discovering their true capabilities and genius, and learning how to amplify that with AI to relaunch themselves as AI-empowered workers of the future.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty;margin:0 0 12px 0;break-inside:avoid\">Other programs focus on upskilling. We train our participants to define their \u201caching gaps,\u201d and leverage AI to fill in those gaps to amplify their current genius, passion, and projects.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty;margin:0 0 12px 0;break-inside:avoid\">We prepare participants to learn across domains, and become more versatile workers who can think critically and creatively.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty;margin:0 0 12px 0;break-inside:avoid\">We also help them relaunch themselves into the modern workplace with the skills, motivation, and confidence necessary to thrive.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty;margin:0 0 12px 0;break-inside:avoid\">Members get access to leadership coaching and training from world-class coaches, facilitators, and AI implementation experts.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty;margin:0 0 12px 0;break-inside:avoid\">Weekly calls, trainings, and mastermind access is included as part of the general Great Repurpose Transition Academy.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14.4px;line-height:1.52;text-wrap:pretty;margin:0 0 12px 0;break-inside:avoid\">If done in conjunction with the Executive Leadership Academy, more specialized support and curated education is available.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#010F32;color:#F4F3F3;padding:17px 48px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:26px;align-items:center;flex:none\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:0.12em;margin:0;color:#06B5B2\">INVESTMENT</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:rgba(244,243,243,0.92);text-wrap:pretty\">A base engagement fee plus a per-seat rate that scales with cohort size \u2014 run standalone or layered onto an existing outplacement vendor. See the pricing sheet for tiers.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/23e67f94-f226-4378-8b3c-c511eac262ab/tgr-mark.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:26px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;display:block\"><span style=\"font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;color:rgba(244,243,243,0.6)\">2 / 2</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>";

